// Draupnir — Dwarf Property-Based Testing Library
// DWARF-119: Property-based testing runtime available to @test functions.
//
// The `for_all` family runs a property against values drawn from
// generators and reports the first counterexample through the Draupnir
// runtime. Fixed-arity variants `for_all_1` .. `for_all_6` take the same
// number of generators followed by the property callback.
//
// NOTE: Function-level generics (`fn for_all<A>(...)`) are not yet
// supported by the parser, so the generic argument is lifted to the
// most permissive concrete types that the current compiler accepts.

